---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Visibility Check — LinksMaxing"
  description="Twenty minutes. Real data. An honest read on what it would take to move the numbers on your business."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-eyebrow">Visibility check</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Find out if AI is <em>naming you.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Twenty minutes. Real data. An honest read on what it would take to move the numbers on your business.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="sec-num">01 / what you get</div>
    <h2 class="sec-head">The check runs against <em>real customer questions.</em></h2>
    <p class="sec-beat">Not a template. Not a screenshot. Actual queries against ChatGPT, Claude, and Google AI — and the correlation between what they name and what your site is prepared to say.</p>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="grid-3-cell">
        <div class="grid-3-label">Deliverable 01</div>
        <div class="grid-3-name">AI recommendation scan</div>
        <div class="grid-3-desc">Every query a customer in your category might ask, run against three AI engines. Who names you. Who names competitors. Who names nobody.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3-cell">
        <div class="grid-3-label">Deliverable 02</div>
        <div class="grid-3-name">Site + GBP audit</div>
        <div class="grid-3-desc">Structural review of your site and Google Business Profile. What's blocking retrieval. What's missing. What's fixable this week.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3-cell">
        <div class="grid-3-label">Deliverable 03</div>
        <div class="grid-3-name">Correlation report</div>
        <div class="grid-3-desc">The signals connected. Which findings point to which decisions. A prioritized list — what to build, what to fix, what to publish, in what order.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="sec-num">02 / how it works</div>
    <h2 class="sec-head">Three steps. <em>Roughly a week.</em></h2>
    <div class="article-body" style="border-top:none;padding-top:0;">
      <h3>1 · Twenty-minute call</h3>
      <p>You tell us about your business, your customers, and what you've tried. We ask the questions we need to build a query set that reflects what your customers actually search.</p>
      <h3>2 · The scan runs</h3>
      <p>We run the query set against ChatGPT, Claude, and Google AI Overviews. In parallel, we audit your site structure and Google Business Profile. The whole process takes 3–5 days.</p>
      <h3>3 · The report</h3>
      <p>You get the raw data and a correlation report — plain language, prioritized. If we're the right team to do the work that comes next, we talk about that. If we're not, you keep the data and take it to whoever is.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-block">
    <h2 class="cta-head">Book the <em>check.</em></h2>
    <p class="cta-sub">If the timing isn't right or we're not a fit, we'll say so on the call. No pressure. No auto-renewal traps. You get the data either way.</p>
    <a href="mailto:harper@linksmaxing.com?subject=Visibility%20check" class="btn">Book a call →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
